 * ```html
 * <span class="pfx-badge-wrapper">
 *   <button class="pfx-button">Inbox</button>
 *   <span class="pfx-badge -placement-top-end">4</span>
 * </span>
 * ```
 * @wrapper pfx-badge-wrapper
 * @structure
 * The badge renders inline on its own, or inside an optional `pfx-badge-wrapper` that anchors it over a target.
 * .pfx-badge-wrapper:opt {
 *   slot {}
 *   .pfx-badge {}
 * }
 * @related pill — The inline label-chip counterpart.
 * @demo self:badge
 * @example -automatica11y
 * ```html
 * <span class="pfx-badge-wrapper">
 *   <button class="pfx-button">Inbox</button>
 *   <span class="pfx-badge -placement-top-end">4</span>
 * </span>
