 * @modifier -color-aurora — Aurora accent status.
 * @modifier -color-sky — Sky accent status.
 * @modifier -color-orange — Orange accent status.
 * @modifier -color-violet — Violet accent status.
 * @modifier -color-sea — Sea accent status.
 * @modifier -color-stone — Stone accent status.
 * @modifier -icon-* — A leading glyph from the icon set (e.g. `-icon-check`), painted before the label.
